<title>AUSTRALIA: Pioneer says looking to expand into India.</title>
<headline>Pioneer says looking to expand into India.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian building materials group Pioneer International Ltd said on Thursday it is looking to expand into India and one other Asian and one European country.</p>
<p>Pioneer chief executive officer John Schubert told reporters that the company had a team in India at the moment looking at starting up operations in its core businesses quarrying, cement and concrete.</p>
<p>Schubert said he could not name the other two countries.</p>
<p>-- Kevin Morrison, Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1813</p>
